{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"fc4564236e3ad71076ed44b678c67d6581a3c5d084477a871eeffdf3670ae182","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大卫的宫殿和家人"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["泰尔王希兰差遣使者带着香柏木、木匠和石匠去为大卫建造宫殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["那时，大卫知道耶和华已立他做以色列王，并因祂以色列子民的缘故而使他国家兴旺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["大卫在耶路撒冷又娶了多位妻子，生了更多儿女。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他在耶路撒冷生的孩子有沙姆亚、朔罢、拿单、所罗门、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["益辖、以利书亚、以法列、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["挪迦、尼斐、雅非亚、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["以利沙玛、比利雅大和以利法列。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["打败非利士人"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["非利士人听说大卫已被膏立为以色列王，就全军出动，搜寻大卫。大卫听说后，便出来迎敌。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["非利士人前来袭击利乏音谷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["大卫求问上帝：“我可以去迎战非利士人吗？你会把他们交在我手里吗？”耶和华说：“去吧，我必把他们交在你手里。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是，大卫前往巴力·毗拉心，在那里打败了他们。他说：“上帝借我的手击溃敌人，如洪水冲垮堤岸。”因此那地方叫巴力·毗拉心",{"noteId":8},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["非利士人在那里丢弃了他们的神像，大卫命人把它们烧掉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["非利士人又来袭击那山谷，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["大卫又求问上帝，上帝对他说：“你不要正面追击他们，要绕到他们后面，从桑林对面攻打他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你一听见桑树梢上响起脚步声，就要进攻，因为那表示上帝已在你前头去攻击非利士的军队了。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["大卫遵命而行，打败非利士军队，从基遍一直杀到基色。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["于是，大卫名扬列国，耶和华使列国都惧怕他。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“巴力·毗拉心”意思是“冲垮之主”。","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}